## Updating the harness

New template versions arrive as a PR on their own (`.github/workflows/harness-update.yml`, setup in `.harness/local/README.md`). Manually:

```sh
rootstock update
```

A new template version is applied with a three-way merge: project edits are kept, a conflict is visible in the file.
